     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I have an app (<a href=\"http://richarddmorey.shinyapps.io/test/download.Rmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://richarddmorey.shinyapps.io/test/download.Rmd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1milKdn-B4F0hAa3PVw0Vv\">richarddmorey.shinyapps.io/test/download.Rmd</a>) that, under some conditions, produces an error (using &quot;stop()&quot;) to restrict people from seeing certain content. When run locally, the error is printed to the app:</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-qlX_N28rt4U/WcoxkSMYarI/AAAAAAAAKYw/2KdEXmm-2MYRVNvuxWxfD-e8TtG2Uvs9gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.49.12.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-qlX_N28rt4U/WcoxkSMYarI/AAAAAAAAKYw/2KdEXmm-2MYRVNvuxWxfD-e8TtG2Uvs9gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2017-09-26%252Bat%252B11.49.12.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuZVZ1-y8hrIfAo7bt-Fr\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-qlX_N28rt4U/WcoxkSMYarI/AAAAAAAAKYw/2KdEXmm-2MYRVNvuxWxfD-e8TtG2Uvs9gCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.49.12.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>When I run this app on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1F1dUVhNI-xpm4yRwjKAMM\">shinyapps.io</a>, the error is not reported, but instead I get a generic error:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pitQV25nSxI/Wcox0AUBjkI/AAAAAAAAKY0/xrpjQkbvJPQVra8YzwZ5gG1C0cmjK50sACLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.49.57.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pitQV25nSxI/Wcox0AUBjkI/AAAAAAAAKY0/xrpjQkbvJPQVra8YzwZ5gG1C0cmjK50sACLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2017-09-26%252Bat%252B11.49.57.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fo6oP1FLQOcSHA-UGKEbf\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pitQV25nSxI/Wcox0AUBjkI/AAAAAAAAKY0/xrpjQkbvJPQVra8YzwZ5gG1C0cmjK50sACLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.49.57.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br><div><br></div><div>The logs show the error, as expected:</div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-JyyL85eB1Es/Wcox6zbopyI/AAAAAAAAKY4/aflGCNXu8qc2yH5gjWSMJf6EZSovnM2QwCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.50.10.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-JyyL85eB1Es/Wcox6zbopyI/AAAAAAAAKY4/aflGCNXu8qc2yH5gjWSMJf6EZSovnM2QwCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2017-09-26%252Bat%252B11.50.10.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a1mO-h926_duPe13-ocDI\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-JyyL85eB1Es/Wcox6zbopyI/AAAAAAAAKY4/aflGCNXu8qc2yH5gjWSMJf6EZSovnM2QwCLcBGAs/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2017-09-26%2Bat%2B11.50.10.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>But this is confusing to users. Is there a way to get <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360555887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08G2xaG6r9K9503JiXsU_6\">shinyapps.io</a> to report the error back to the user, instead of the &quot;Check logs&quot; error message?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Richard</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
